# SMART FARM MQTT ACL Template
#
# This file contains no password.
# Provision a separate MQTT username and an ACL block for every ESP32.

# Backend MQTT service
user smartfarm_backend
topic readwrite farm/#

# ESP32 example:
# Replace ESP32_DEVICE_CODE, FARM_CODE, and ZONE_CODE before deployment.
user ESP32_DEVICE_CODE
topic write farm/FARM_CODE/esp32/ESP32_DEVICE_CODE/status
topic write farm/FARM_CODE/esp32/ESP32_DEVICE_CODE/telemetry
topic write farm/FARM_CODE/zone/ZONE_CODE/sensor/+/reading
topic write farm/FARM_CODE/zone/ZONE_CODE/actuator/+/state
topic write farm/FARM_CODE/zone/ZONE_CODE/actuator/+/ack
topic read farm/FARM_CODE/zone/ZONE_CODE/actuator/+/command